cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to Praxis, please cite it as below."
title: "Praxis: an independent evidence-based knowledge base for prosthetics and orthotics"
abstract: >-
  An independent, non-commercial knowledge base bridging evidence-based research and
  clinical practice in prosthetics and orthotics in Ukraine, including combat-related
  polytrauma. Critical appraisal of studies, clinical biomechanics and practical
  takeaways for multidisciplinary rehabilitation teams. Ukrainian and English.
authors:
